{"resource":{"id":"rust-sample-exercises","title":"Rust \u2014 Sample Exercises","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"25 min","pages":19,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A 200+ exercise workbook covering ownership, borrowing, lifetimes, traits, generics, collections, smart pointers, Cargo, testing, concurrency, async, files, and networking."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Syntax & Basics"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Ownership & Borrowing"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Lifetimes"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Structs & Enums"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Traits & Generics"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Collections & Smart Pointers"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Cargo & Testing"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Concurrency & Async"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Files & Networking"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Debugging Drills"},{"id":"diagrams","label":"Architecture Diagrams"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust \u2014 Practice Questions","tag":"Programming","time":"21 min"},{"title":"Rust \u2014 Answer Key","tag":"Programming","time":"26 min"},{"title":"Rust \u2014 Project Guide","tag":"Programming","time":"17 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Practice 200+ progressively harder Rust exercises.</li>\n          <li>Internalize ownership, borrowing, and lifetimes through repetition.</li>\n          <li>Build muscle memory for Cargo, tests, concurrency, and async.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">How to use</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Attempt each drill on paper, then verify with <code>cargo run</code>. Track completion in a checklist.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Syntax &amp; Basics (20 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={1}>Write a program that prints \"Hello, EduNova!\" using <code>println!</code>.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={2}>Declare an immutable integer and try to reassign it \u2014 observe the error.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={3}>Use shadowing to convert a <code>String</code> length into its numeric value:\n          <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>let s = &quot;hello&quot;;\nlet s = s.len(); // shadow with a new type</code></pre></div>\n        </Ex>\n        <Ex n={4}>Loop from 1..=100 printing FizzBuzz.</Ex>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Practice loop: read \u2192 predict \u2192 run \u2192 reflect.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Ownership &amp; Borrowing (25 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={30}>Take a <code>String</code> by value and return its length \u2014 then rewrite to accept <code>&amp;str</code>.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={31}>Given <code>let s = String::from(\"a\"); let t = s;</code> \u2014 explain why <code>s</code> is unusable.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={32}>Write a function that mutates a <code>Vec&lt;i32&gt;</code> via a mutable reference.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Lifetimes (15 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={55}>Annotate a <code>longest</code> function returning the longer of two <code>&amp;str</code>.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={56}>Design a struct holding a borrowed slice and explain the required lifetime parameter.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Structs &amp; Enums (20 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={70}>Model <code>enum Shape</code> with Circle, Square, Rect and compute area via <code>match</code>.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={71}>Derive <code>Debug, Clone, PartialEq</code> on a struct and write a unit test.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Traits &amp; Generics (25 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={95}>Implement <code>Display</code> for a <code>Point&#123;x,y&#125;</code> struct.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={96}>Write <code>fn largest&lt;T: PartialOrd + Copy&gt;(v: &amp;[T]) -&gt; T</code>.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Collections &amp; Smart Pointers (20 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={120}>Build a <code>HashMap&lt;String, u32&gt;</code> word counter.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={121}>Use <code>Rc&lt;RefCell&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code> to model a shared mutable graph node.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Cargo &amp; Testing (25 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={145}>Create a workspace with two crates; expose an API and unit-test it.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={146}>Add a feature flag and use <code>#[cfg(feature = \"premium\")]</code>.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Concurrency &amp; Async (25 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={170}>Spawn 8 threads that increment a shared <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;u32&gt;&gt;</code>.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={171}>With Tokio, fetch 5 URLs concurrently via <code>join_all</code>.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Files &amp; Networking (15 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={195}>Read a text file line-by-line and count occurrences of a word.</Ex>\n        <Ex n={196}>Build a TCP echo server using <code>std::net::TcpListener</code>.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Debugging Drills (10 exercises)</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Ex n={210}>Fix \"cannot borrow as mutable more than once\" using scoping.</Ex>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"diagrams\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Architecture Diagrams</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Exercise Flow\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRead \u2192 Draft \u2192 Compile \u2192 Fix \u2192 Refactor \u2192 Test \u2192 Commit</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Deliberate-practice loop for Rust drills.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Solve on paper before typing.</li>\n          <li>Time-box each exercise to 15 minutes.</li>\n          <li>Refactor after passing tests.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Skipping compiler messages instead of reading them.</li>\n          <li>Cloning to escape the borrow checker.</li>\n          <li>Ignoring warnings until they pile up.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Tip</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Enable <code>#![deny(warnings)]</code> in scratch crates.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Repetition + reading the compiler = Rust fluency. Chase clarity, not cleverness.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How long to finish?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">2\u20133 weeks at one hour a day.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need nightly?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No \u2014 stable Rust covers every exercise.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Exercises are for study; multiple valid solutions exist.</p>\n      </div></section>"}